            "description": "ADMIN/TEAM_LEAD/DEVELOPER. multipart/form-data, field name must be 'file'. Allowed types: PDF, DOCX, PNG, JPG/JPEG, max size per MAX_FILE_SIZE env var. Select a file in the Body tab before sending.",
